  "content": "<p>這個組合包是為那些懷念Java版尚未有《Actions &amp; Stuff》（還差一點...）而想找東西填補空缺的人所設計的。這是《Java &amp; Stuff》（眾多版本之一），一個帶來了部分ANS核心體驗的模組包。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/60ef0e6dd5a02340948789f3427cc5d6fb38fbe5.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h2>如有任何疑問或建議，歡迎加入Discord！</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>此組合包包含：</h2><ul>\n<li>流暢的實體動畫</li>\n<li>玩家動畫</li>\n<li>第一人稱動畫</li>\n<li>粒子效果</li>\n<li>附魔輪廓</li>\n<li>3D物品</li>\n<li>新型爆炸效果</li>\n<li>光影著色器</li>\n<li>效能強化模組！</li>\n</ul><h2>內容一覽</h2><h3>模組</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-fps\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic FPS</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entityculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">EntityCulling</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explosive-enhancement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Explosive Enhancement</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ferritecore-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hold-my-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold My Items</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immediatelyfast\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immediately Fast</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irisshaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lithium</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moreculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Culling</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-resource-pack-warnings\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Resource Pack Warnings</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particular-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particular Reforged</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/text-placeholder-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Placeholder API</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visuality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visuality</a></p><h2>資源包</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbrays-better-enchanted-outlines\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bray's Better Enchantment Outlines</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/endl3sss-trident-remodel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Endl3ss's Trident Remodel</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffa-extensions-brays-chestfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA Extensions - Bray's Chest GUI Fix</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffa-playerhmi\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Player × HMI Patches</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Creepers</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-emissive\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Emissive</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-objects\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Objects</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fa-player-extension\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Player Extension</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-spiders\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Spiders</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252flow-fire-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Low Fire</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rays-3d-ladders\" rel=\"nofollow\">RAY's 3D Ladders</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rays-3d-rails\" rel=\"nofollow\">RAY's 3D Rails</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftools-and-utils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weskerson's 3D Items</a></p><h2>光影著色器</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/visual-vibrance\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visual Vibrance</a></p>",
